    <rnb>139</rnb>
    <tib>rdo rje sems dpa'/ yi ge brgya pa'i rgyud/ thugs 'phrin las thaMd dam tshig gi rgyud ces bya ba</tib>
    <skt>badzra satwa sha ta tak+Sha ra rtsi karma sarba sa ma ya tan tra nA ma</skt>
    <coloph>de nas ston pa nyid mya ngan las 'das so// //'khor du 'dus sgyu 'phrul zhi khro'i lha tshogs rnams dang/ /yang phur bdud rtsi ma gshin dbang gi dkyil 'khor gyi lha rnams la/ /tshangs pa dang brgya sbyin dang/ /'jig rten skyong ba dang/ thugs bzangs ris dang/ /sde brgyad dang/ phyogs skyong ba bcu dang/ rdo rje drag po la sogs te/ /mkhA 'gro ma rnams dang/ lag na rdo rje yi rang ste / mngon par bstod pas bstod do/ /thugs rtse gcig pa'i badzra pa' nis bsdus te/ / sprul sku pad+ma 'byung gnas la gtad pa'o/ /rdo rje sems dpa' yi ge brgya pa'i thugs phrin las thams cad dam tshig gi rgyud ces bya ba rdzogs so// //sprul sku pad ma 'byung gnas dang / dge slong nam mkha'i snying po'i bsgyur ba/ /rje 'bangs grogs gsum la gdams pa'o/ /rgyud 'di dbang mchog rgyud kyi kha bskongs pa'i rgyud do// // gter rgya/ sbas rgya/ gtad rgya/ sarba mangga laM// //gsang ba'i yang gsang rdzogs chen bka' gter gyi/ /rgyud kyi glegs bam lha gcig rnal 'byor ma/ /'gyur med chos 'dzin thugs dgongs dag pas bzhengs/ /dge bas bstan pa rgyas sogs rgyu sbyor gyi/ /rnam dag bzhedon kun 'grub bkra shis shog</coloph>
